      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IM CATEGORY FIVE (11) finished fourth last start, beaten 8 metres at this track over 2185m. May just need a bit of luck at some point from this difficult draw. Meets a similar line up so she can play a big role in the outcome. SHOO BOOZY (1) turned in an out-of-character effort last time out when 30 metres away in seventh over 2130m at Gloucester Park. Form prior to that had been solid. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Her recent effort is not a true indication. Good enough to put herself right in the finish. MAAS ATTACK (12) didn't do a bad job when sixth over 2130m at Gloucester Park last time out. Rates well as an each-way chance. SKYHIGH ADDA (2) last appeared when she won by 3.5 metres over 2242m at Narrogin nine weeks ago. Should be thereabouts.",
